<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>En Construcción</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login-style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unicons.iconscout.com/release/v4.0.0/css/line.css">
    <style>
        .construction-container { max-width:600px; margin:100px auto; text-align:center; padding:40px; background:#f8f9fa; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #dee2e6; }
        .construction-icon { font-size:80px; color:#007bff; margin-bottom:20px; }
        .construction-title { font-size:28px; color:#333; margin-bottom:10px; }
        .construction-text { color:#666; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:30px; }
        .back-btn { display:inline-block; padding:10px 20px; background:#007bff; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; transition:background .2s; }
        .back-btn:hover { background:#0056b3; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="construction-container">
        <div class="construction-icon"><i class="uil uil-constructor"></i></div>
        <h1 class="construction-title">Funcionalidad en Construcción</h1>
        <p class="construction-text">Esta sección estará disponible próximamente. ¡Gracias por tu paciencia!</p>
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="back-btn">Volver al menú</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
